>Kitai</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Managing obesity: a survey of attitudes and practices among Israeli primary care physicians</article-title><source>Int J Obes Relat Metab Disord</source><year>2002</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>1393</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12355337</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.ijo.0802063</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brotons</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ciurana</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pineiro</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kloppe</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Godycki-Cwirko</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sammut</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dietary advice in clinical practice: the views of general practitioners in Europe</article-title><source>Am J Clin Nutr</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>1048S</fpage><lpage>51S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12663317</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stafford</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Farhat</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Misra</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Schoenfeld</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>National patterns of physician activities related to obesity management</article-title><source>Arch Fam Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>631</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10910311</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/archfami.9.7.631</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Galuska</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Will</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Serdula</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Ford</surname><given-names>ES</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Are health care professionals advising obese patients to lose weight?</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1999</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>1576</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10546698</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.282.16.1576</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wee</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarthy</surname><given-names>EP</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillips</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Physician counseling about exercise</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1999</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>1583</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10546701</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.282.16.1583</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Glasgow</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Eakin</surname><given-names>EG</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>EB</given-names></name><name><surname>Bacak</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brownson</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Physician advice and support for physical activity: results from a national survey</article-title><source>Am J Prev Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>189</fpage><lpage>96</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11567839</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0749-3797(01)00350-6</pub-id>